    fix(df-0926-01): make the examples on-ramp runnable and the bind lifecycle truthful
    
    The P0 examples on-ramp could not be followed end to end, and a second
    `duckbrain http` on an occupied port announced success, clobbered the live
    daemon's pidfile and exited 0. The source half of the fix is already in HEAD
    (listenTcp defers its resolution one macrotask so a pending EADDRINUSE wins the
    race, and the started banner / stale-pidfile cleanup / pidfile write now run
    only after a successful bind — src/cli/http.ts, ae7ab2e). This commit completes
    the user-visible half:
    
    - AC1  every documented invocation is runnable: `pnpm start -- http ...`
      forwards a literal `--` under the pinned pnpm (Unknown command: --, exit 1).
      All sites across README.md, docs/api/http-api.md, docs/dogfood/* and the
      three example READMEs now use `pnpm start http ...` or invoke the entry point
      directly; `grep -rn "pnpm start --" README.md docs examples` is zero-hit.
    - AC2  examples/http-api/client.js is plain CommonJS (it was ESM with
      import.meta inside a "type": "commonjs" repo) and its payloads pass the
      server's own validation: keys start with "/", content is a plain string,
      recall goes through GET /api/memories/key/:key, keyword search uses ?contains=.
    - AC3/AC4  regression coverage in src/cli/http.test.ts (bind conflict exits
      nonzero with no started banner, the live occupant's pidfile is untouched, the
      challenger writes no pidfile of its own) plus a hermetic end-to-end suite
      tests/examples-onramp-df092601.int.test.ts that runs the committed client
      against a scratch daemon.
    - AGENTS.md test counts synced to the live suite (178 suites, 1414 tests) — the
      new test file would otherwise red the CI count assert (GAP-012 class).
    
    Live acceptance evidence (foreman, scratch daemon on a scratch port, killed by
    explicit PID):
      challenger exit=1 · "Failed to start HTTP server: Error: listen EADDRINUSE"
      · no "HTTP server started" banner · occupant pidfile sha256 identical before
      and after · no challenger pidfile · occupant still serving 200
      · `node examples/http-api/client.js` printed steps 1-4 and exited 0
    
    Gates: prettier --check src/ examples/ clean; tsc --noEmit exit 0;
    vitest run 178 suites / 1414 tests passed; targeted integration 2/2 passed;
    scripts/sync-agents-md-counts.sh --check matches live.
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
